# LF everywhere: canonical LF in the repo also on disk (Windows + WSL), so no mixed-EOL churn
* text=auto eol=lf
*.joblib binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
# WAVs are binary too. `text=auto` already detects them by their NUL bytes and
# stores them byte-identical, but relying on that heuristic means a 13MB asset
# tree's integrity depends on a sniff test rather than on the rule.
*.wav binary


